OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings 85mph gusts and
OL,4,Atravel disruption with amber weather
OL,5,Awarnings in effect
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is bringing more travel
OL,8,Fdisruption to the UK, afters gusts of
OL,9,F85mph (137 km/h) were recorded
OL,10,Fovernight
OL,12,FOn the railways, people are being told
OL,13,Fnot to travel north of Preston on the
OL,14,FWest Coast Main Line - while on the
OL,15,FEast Coast, LNER advises against travel
OL,16,Fnorth of Edinburgh. Many ferry services
OL,17,Fare also suspended
OL,19,FAmber warnings for wind remain in place
OL,20,Facross large parts of Scotland,
OL,21,Fnorthern England and parts of Northern
OL,22,FIreland
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
