OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings 85mph gusts and
OL,4,Atravel disruption with amber weather
OL,5,Awarnings in effect
OL,6,
OL,7,FA further yellow warning for wind will
OL,8,Fremain in place until 21:00 GMT for
OL,9,Fmost of Scotland, including the Orkney
OL,10,FIslands, and northern England
OL,12,FThe Met Office says strong winds could
OL,13,Fcause power cuts, flying debris, damage
OL,14,Fto buildings and trees, as well as
OL,15,Ftravel disruption
